Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.57,0:00:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you\N♪ 你是我的 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonlight\N♪ 皎洁月光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my\N♪ 你是我的 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Starlite\N♪ 璀璨星光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you\N♪ 我需要你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.44,0:00:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All Night\N♪ 一整夜 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, dance with me\N♪ 来与我共舞吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, dance with me\N♪ 来吧，与我共舞 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm levitating\N♪ 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanna run away with me, I know a galaxy\N♪ 若你想与我私奔 我知道一个星系 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can take you for a ride\N♪ 我能带你去那里遨游兜风 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a premonition that we fell into a rhythm\N♪ 预感我们将沉浸于这节奏 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the music don't stop for life\N♪ 音乐不息 生命不止 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.33,0:00:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Glitter in the sky, glitter in my eyes\N♪ 天际璀璨 映于我眸 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining just the way I like\N♪ 闪耀如我所愿 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.17,0:00:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're feeling like you need a little bit of company\N♪ 若你此刻需要陪伴 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.19,0:00:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You met me at the perfect time\N♪ 你我在最完美的时间相遇 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me, I want you, baby\N♪ 你渴望我 我亦需要你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My sugarboo, I'm levitating\N♪ 我的甜心 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Milky Way, we're renegading\N♪ 我们将一同逃离银河系 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.74,0:00:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you, moonlight, you're my starlight\N♪ 你是我的月光 独一无二的星光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:01:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you all night, come on, dance with me\N♪ 我整夜都需要你 来与我共舞吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm levitating\N♪ 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
