Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm levitating\N♪ 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.06,0:01:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that you're for me, I feel it in our energy\N♪ 我坚信你属于我 能量已诉说明晰 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I see us written in the stars\N♪ 我们的名字刻于星辰 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.71,0:01:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go wherever, so let's do it now or never\N♪ 我们可以去任何地方 此刻莫再犹豫 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.69,0:01:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, nothing's ever, ever too far\N♪ 亲爱的 没有什么是遥不可及 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Glitter in the sky, glitter in our eyes\N♪ 天际璀璨 映于你我双眸 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining just the way we are\N♪ 闪耀如我们本真模样 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.81,0:01:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like we're forever every time we get together\N♪ 每次相聚都恍若永恒 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.07,0:01:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever, let's get lost on Mars\N♪ 但无论如何 让我们在火星恣意流浪 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me, I want you, baby\N♪ 你渴望我 我亦需要你 ♪
